# Not the manifest of a published .vsix -- there is no .vsix.
#
# The daemon this extension drives is the repo above it: `bin/cljd-resolve`
# runs babashka against `bb.edn` and `src/`, which in turn runs a Dart helper
# that only works after a `dart pub get` in `helper/` on the machine using it.
# None of that can travel inside an extension package, so the supported
# install is a symlink into this repo -- README, *Install*.
#
# These two lines stay only so that an ad-hoc `vsce package` does not sweep up
# editor droppings along with the files that are actually the extension.
.vscode/**
**/*.map
